## 🔢 Core Entities — Board, Piece, Player, Game

A clean OOP model needs exactly four entities:

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class PlayingPiece {
        +PieceType type
    }
    class Player {
        +String name
        +PlayingPiece piece
    }
    class Board {
        +int size
        +PlayingPiece[][] grid
        +placePiece(row, col, piece)
        +isFull()
    }
