        +WinningStrategy strategy
        +startGame()
        +checkWinner(row, col, piece)
    }
    Player --> PlayingPiece
    Game --> Board
    Game --> Player
    Game --> WinningStrategy
```

**Enums and value objects first:**

```java
enum PieceType { X, O, STAR, HASH }  // extensible — add symbols without changing Board

class PlayingPiece {
    final PieceType type;
    PlayingPiece(PieceType t) { this.type = t; }
}

class Player {
    final String name;
    final PlayingPiece piece;
    Player(String name, PlayingPiece piece) {
        this.name  = name;
        this.piece = piece;
    }
}
