## ⚖️ Trade-offs & Failure Modes: Trade-offs and Production Constraints

| Decision | Default choice | Why | Production consideration |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| Matching scope | Nearest available driver (Haversine) | Simple, correct for small fleets | Switch to geospatial index (PostGIS / S2) at scale |
| State storage | Single-node in-memory | Easy to start | Use distributed state (Redis, DB) in production |
| Observer delivery | Synchronous in-process | Simple | Use event bus / message queue for multi-service delivery |
| Pricing logic | Strategy pattern (swappable) | Good OCP compliance | Add audit log per fare calculation |
| Duplicate trips | Not handled in basic LLD | Simplified | Require idempotency key per ride request |

