## 📊 SRP Responsibility Flow

When a request hits `UserRegistrationService.register()`, responsibility flows cleanly to dedicated single-purpose classes — each is an isolated change axis.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["register(user)"] --> B[UserRepository.save]
    A --> C[WelcomeEmailService.sendWelcome]
    A --> D[UserAuditLogger.logCreated]
    B --> E[(Database)]
    C --> F[Email Provider]
    D --> G[Audit Log]
```

If the database schema changes, only `UserRepository` is modified. If the email template changes, only `WelcomeEmailService` is touched. The orchestrator `UserRegistrationService` never changes for infrastructure reasons — only if the registration workflow itself changes.

