| Implementation complexity | Low | None (use `Arrays.sort`) | Medium |

The heap is the right default choice for interviews and production systems where K ≪ N, data may arrive in a stream, or memory is constrained. Reach for QuickSelect only when the problem explicitly asks for the Kth value and you need to minimize average time.

