| **High-traffic user-facing database (e.g. checkout, auth)** | Expand-Contract Pattern | Highly recommended to preserve SLAs. |
| **Internal reporting DB or low-traffic admin panel** | Scheduled Maintenance Window | Execute a simple locking `ALTER` during off-peak hours to save engineering time. |
